    "„Lebendigkeit“ steuert, wie stark Satzrhythmus und Aussprache variieren. Höher = ausdrucksstärker, aber weniger vorhersehbar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Liveliness” controls how much sentence rhythm and pronunciation vary. Higher = more expressive, but less predictable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
